1783 0 obj
  << /ActualText (Senior Art Director \024 ecobee \n\0502017\0552021\051\n\nDirected end\055to\055end digital design and brand experiences that elevated ecobee as a top Canadian tech company\054 ultimately contributing to its successful acquisition\056\015\n\nLed creative strategy across all touchpoints for 4 major product launches\054 collaborating seamlessly with product designers\054 engineers\054 and product managers from early development to release\056\015\n\nSpearheaded a strategic brand overhaul\054 developing comprehensive brand guidelines\054 establishing sonic branding\054 and producing extensive photography and VFX assets\056\015\n\nSupported the foundational design of ecobee\047s first SaaS platform from scratch\054 directly contributing to significant new company revenue streams\056\015\n\n Voluntarily expanded scope into UX research to build a firmer grasp of technical features and user needs\054 ultimately earning the AVA Platinum Award for Digital Campaign excellence\056\n\n\nXM Designer \024 Mosaic North America\n\0502016 \055 2017\051\015\n\nConceptualized and designed high\055impact experiential marketing \050XM\051 campaigns\054 driving immersive brand activations from initial ideation through to final production\056\n\nDelivered memorable consumer experiences for a portfolio of top\055tier global and national brands\054 including Google\054 Samsung Canada\054 RBC\054 and Bud Light\056\n\n\n\nArt Director \024 Dentsu Creative\n\0502014\0552016\051\015\n\nProvided global art direction for high\055profile accounts\054 including Lexus\054 Manulife\054 Uniqlo\054 and Elevation Pictures\054 bridging brand strategies across markets in Japan and Toronto\056\n\nSpearheaded the design of compelling pitch decks and campaign prototypes\054 directly contributing to agency business contracts and client retention\056\n\nCollaborated closely with the studio production team to develop high\055fidelity mockups\054 ensuring strict adherence to design standards and creative excellence\056\n\nDirected end\055to\055end asset production across multiple mediums\054 overseeing photography\054 film\054 and print campaigns\056\n\n\nJr\056 Art Director \024 OgilvyOne \042 Ogilvy \046 Mather\n\0502013\0552014\051\015\n\nDelivered impactful art direction and campaign execution for major global and national brands\054 including American Express\054 Unilever\054 Tim Hortons\054 and Oreo\056\n\nDesigned and rolled out creative assets across a diverse range of mediums\054 executing strategies for print\054 social media\054 and Out\055of\055Home \050OOH\051 advertising\056\n\nProduced custom illustrations and original graphic assets\054 constructing precise layouts while maintaining strict alignment with complex brand guidelines\056\n\n\n\n\n\n)
     /K [ 9 ]
     /P 1784 0 R
     /Pg 1771 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
endobj

