1809 0 obj
  << /ActualText (Lead Designer \024 Float Financial\015\n\0502025 \023 Present\051\015\n\015\nLead all brand and marketing design initiatives\054 establishing the visual strategy and maintaining a high bar of quality across all growth channels\056\015\n\nPartner cross\055functionally with Product Marketing Managers \050PMMs\051 and the Product Design team to strategize and execute high\055converting growth marketing campaigns\056\015\n\015\nDirect the design and launch of complex web projects\054 landing pages\054 and end\055to\055end campaign rollouts\054 ensuring alignment with overarching business goals\056\015\n\nLead rebrand initiative from concept to full blown new visual identity for Float\056 Include owning the redesign and overhaul of site over to Webflow\056 \050\050\n\050Senior Digital Designer \024 Loblaw \050PC Optimum\051\n\0502024\0552025\051\n\nEstablished and scaled the Email Design Library\054 translating core brand guidelines into a robust system of reusable components to streamline design workflows\056\015\n\nLed CRM and digital design execution for major marketing campaigns\054 including high\055visibility mobile app offer updates across the broader PC Optimum ecosystem\056\015\n\nConceptualized\054 designed\054 and owned the end\055to\055end creative launch for the high\055profile DoorDash and PC Optimum partnership\056\n\n\050\050Product Designer \024 Brunch\n\050Jan 2024 \055 Aug 2024\051\050\nDeveloped the design system for our client rtings\056com\054 a consumer product review network\056\n\nCollaborated cross\055functionally with the product design team and with client product managers and engineers through weekly shares\056 Delivered end to end experience for the revamp\056\050\nDesigned a custom set of 26 icons in the Lucide icon family that were contributed to the Github community\056\n\n\n \050Senior Art Director \057 Interactive Designer \024 Square \n\0502021\0552024\051\n\nDirected design and art direction for 4 distinct Square products\054 creating responsive landing pages and foundational assets that drove product education for newly launched features\056\015\n\nPartnered cross\055functionally with research\054 product marketing\054 and engineering to align on content strategy\054 oversee development QA\054 and continuously iterate designs based on user metrics\056\015\n\nScaled localized designs across various core user segments and global regions\054 directing the creation of digital\054 photo\054 and video assets \050including the Square for Coffee Shops feature\051\056\015\n\nActed as a people lead and mentor for the design team\054 fostering a highly collaborative and inspiring environment through regular design critiques\054 team rituals\054 and brainstorms\056\n\n\n\n\n)
